  "description": "Amelie Grint always topped her class as an education major at the Capital Academy. However, following the sudden death of her parents, her family's wealth is seized by her older brother, leaving her struggling even to afford her academy tuition.    \nUltimately, she takes on a secret side job as a lingerie model—something she has never done in her life—while working as a private tutor for the Estrissen ducal household. Then one day, due to an accidental mishap, the Duke discovers the lingerie she is wearing beneath her clothes...\n\n\"Wearing this kind of underwear, designed entirely to please men, you've been teaching the child I protect.\"\n\nEver since that day, the Duke of Estrissen's gaze toward Amelie begins to change.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14708763), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/6026000056)",
